00:24:02.272 --> 00:24:06.902
One way we try to prevent banana disease is by growing the earliest

00:24:06.912 --> 00:24:11.622
shoots in labs, thereby guaranteeing that they're not going to be sick when

00:24:11.632 --> 00:24:13.142
